hadiths[58]{hadithnumber,text}:
"425","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lazzaton ko khatm karne wali cheez maut ko kasrat se yaad karo. Ise Tirmidhi aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"426","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi kisi takleef ke sabab jo use pahunche maut ki tamanna na kare; phir agar zaroor tamanna karne wala ho to kahe: Aey Allah! Mujhe zinda rakh jab tak zindagi mere liye behtar ho, aur mujhe wafat de jab wafat mere liye behtar ho. Muttafaq alaih."
"427","[AI-translation] Hazrat Buraidah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Mu'min peshani ke paseene se marta hai. Ise Salasa ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"428","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id aur Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne marne walon ko La ilaha illallah ki talqeen karo. Ise Muslim aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya."
"429","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ma'qil bin Yasar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne marne walon par Surah Yasin padho. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"430","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Abu Salamah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aae jabke un ki aankh khul gayi thi, to Aap ne use band kiya, phir farmaya: Beshak rooh jab qabz ki jati hai to aankh us ka peecha karti hai. To un ke ghar walon mein se kuch log cheekhne lage, to Aap ne farmaya: Apne nafs par siwae khair ke bad-dua na karo, kyunke farishte tum jo kehte ho us par amin kehte hain. Phir farmaya: Aey Allah Abu Salamah ko bakhsh de, hidayat walon mein us ka darja buland farma, us ki qabr mein kushadgi farma, us mein us ke liye roshni farma, aur us ki aulad mein us ka khalifa bana. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"431","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab wafat pa gae to Aap ko Yaman ki dhari-dar chadar odhai gayi. Muttafaq alaih."
"432","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka maut ke baad bosa liya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"433","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Mu'min ki jaan us ke qarz se atki rehti hai yahan tak ke us ki taraf se ada kiya jae. Ise Ahmad aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha."
"434","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us shakhs ke bare mein farmaya jo apni sawari se gir kar mar gaya tha: Use pani aur beri ke patton se ghusl do aur use do kapdon mein kafnao. Muttafaq alaih."
"435","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke jab unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ghusl dene ka irada kiya to kahne lage: Allah ki qasam ham nahin jante, kya ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko nanga karen jaise ham apne murdon ko nanga karte hain ya nahin?... Al-hadees. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya."
"436","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas aae jabke ham Aap ki beti ko ghusl de rahi thin, to Aap ne farmaya: Use teen ya paanch ya us se ziyada martaba ghusl do agar tum aisa dekho, pani aur beri ke patton se, aur aakhir mein kafoor ya kuch kafoor rakho. Phir jab ham farigh huin to Aap ko ittila di, to Aap ne apna tahband hamari taraf dala aur farmaya: Use us ka andar ka kapda banao. Muttafaq alaih; aur ek riwayat mein hai: Us ke dayan aur wuzu ki jaghon se shuru karo. Aur Bukhari ke ek lafz mein hai ke ham ne us ke balon ki teen chotiyan banain aur unhen peeche dal diya."
"437","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko teen safed sahuli qatan ke kapdon mein kafnaya gaya jin mein qameez aur amama na tha. Muttafaq alaih."
"438","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke jab Abdullah bin Ubayy ka inteqal hua to us ka beta Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Mujhe apni qameez den taake main use us mein kafnaun, to Aap ne use de di. Muttafaq alaih."
"439","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne safed kapde pahno kyunke woh tumhare behtareen kapdon mein se hain, aur unhi mein apne murdon ko kafnao. Ise Khamsa ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha."
"440","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bhai ko kafnae to us ka kafan achcha banae. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"441","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Uhud ke shaheedon mein se do aadmiyon ko ek kapde mein jama farmate, phir farmate: In mein Quran ka sab se bada hasil karne wala kaun hai? To use lahd mein aage farmate; aur unhen ghusl na diya gaya aur na un par namaz padhi gayi. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"442","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Kafan mein ghulu na karo kyunke woh jald utar liya jata hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya."
"443","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Agar tum mujh se pahle mar jaon to main tumhen ghusl dunga. Al-hadees. Ise Ahmad aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"444","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Umais (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Fatimah Alaihassalam ne wasiyat ki ke Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) unhen ghusl den. Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya."
"445","[AI-translation] Hazrat Buraidah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Ghamidiyah aurat ke qisse mein jis ke rajm ka Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne zina mein hukm diya tha riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne us ke bare mein hukm diya to us par namaz padhi gayi aur dafan ki gayi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"446","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Samurah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ek aadmi laya gaya jis ne tiron se apni jaan le li thi, to Aap ne us par namaz na padhi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"447","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se us aurat ke qisse mein jo masjid mein jhadu deti thi riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ke bare mein poocha [to unhon ne kaha: Woh mar gayi. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne mujhe ittila na di? To goya unhon ne us ke mamle ko halka samjha] phir Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe us ki qabr batao. To unhon ne bataya aur Aap ne us par namaz padhi. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ne izafa kiya, phir farmaya: Beshak yeh qabren apne walon par andhere se bhari hain, aur beshak Allah meri un par namaz se unhen roshan karta hai."
"448","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) na'i [maut ki khabar mashhoor karne] se mana farmate the. Ise Ahmad aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha."
"449","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Najashi ki us din khabar di jis din woh mara tha, aur unhen lekar eidgah se bahar nikle, unhen saf mein khada kiya aur us par chaar takbiren kahin. Muttafaq alaih."
"450","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo bhi Musalman aadmi mare aur us ke janaze par chalis aadmi khade hon jo Allah ke sath kuch shareek na karte hon to Allah un ki us ke bare mein shafa'at qabool karta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"451","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samurah bin Jundub (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche ek aurat par namaz padhi jo nifas mein mari thi, to Aap us ke darmiyan khade hue. Muttafaq alaih."
"452","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Allah ki qasam Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne masjid mein Bani Baiza ke beton par namaz padhi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"453","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Abi Laila se riwayat hai ke Zaid bin Arqam hamare janazon par chaar takbiren kehte, aur unhon ne ek janaze par paanch takbiren kahin, to main ne poocha to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aisa takbir kehte the. Ise Muslim aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya."
"454","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Sahl bin Hunaif par chhe takbiren kahin aur kaha: Woh Badri hain. Ise Sa'id bin Mansur ne riwayat kiya; aur is ki asl Bukhari mein hai."
"455","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare janazon par chaar takbiren kehte aur pehli takbir mein Fatihat al-Kitab padhte. Ise Shafi'i ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"456","[AI-translation] Hazrat Talhah bin Abdullah bin Awf se riwayat hai ke main ne Ibn Abbas ke peeche janaze par namaz padhi to unhon ne Fatihat al-Kitab padhi aur kaha: Taake tum jano ke yeh sunnat hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"457","[AI-translation] Hazrat Awf bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne janaze par namaz padhai to main ne Aap ki dua mein se yaad kiya: Aey Allah use bakhsh de, us par raham farma, use afiyat de, use mu'af farma, us ki mehmani ko izzat de, us ke dakhil ki jagah kushada farma, use pani barf aur ole se dho de, use khaton se pak farma jaise Tu ne safed kapde ko mel se pak kiya, use us ke ghar se behtar ghar aur us ke ghar walon se behtar ghar wale badal de, use jannat mein dakhil farma, aur use qabr ke fitne aur aag ke azab se bacha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"458","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab janaze par namaz padhte to farmate: Aey Allah hamare zinda aur murda, hazir aur ghaib, chhote aur bade, mard aur aurat ko bakhsh de; Aey Allah ham mein se jise Tu zinda rakhe use Islam par zinda rakh, aur ham mein se jise Tu wafat de use iman par wafat de; Aey Allah hamen us ke ajr se mahrum na farma aur us ke baad hamen gumrah na farma. Ise Muslim aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya."
"459","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum maiyyat par namaz padho to us ke liye dua khalis karo. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"460","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Janaze mein jaldi karo; phir agar woh nek ho to khair hai jis ki taraf tum use aage karte ho, aur agar us ke siwa ho to sharr hai jo tum apni gardanon se utarte ho. Muttafaq alaih."
"461","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo janaze mein hazir ho yahan tak ke us par namaz padhi jae to us ke liye ek qeerat hai, aur jo us mein hazir ho yahan tak ke dafan kiya jae to us ke liye do qeerat hain. Kaha gaya: Do qeerat kya hain? Aap ne farmaya: Do bade pahadon jaisa. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ke han hai: Yahan tak ke lahd mein rakha jae. Aur Bukhari ke han hai: Jo Musalman ke janaze ke peeche iman aur sawab ki niyyat se chale aur us ke sath rahe yahan tak ke us par namaz padhi jae aur dafan se farigh ho to woh do qeerat lekar wapas hota hai, har qeerat Uhud jaisa hai."
"462","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salim apne walid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte hain ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr aur Umar ko janaze ke aage chalte dekha. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha, aur Nasai aur ek giroh ne ise mursal hone se ma'lul kaha."
"463","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke hamen janazon ke peeche chalne se mana kiya gaya magar ham par sakhti na ki gayi. Muttafaq alaih."
"464","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum janaza dekho to khade ho jao; phir jo us ke peeche chale woh na baithe yahan tak ke rakha jae. Muttafaq alaih."
"465","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ishaq se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Yazid (Raziyallahu anhu) ne maiyyat ko qabr ke pairon ki taraf se dakhil kiya aur kaha: Yeh sunnat mein se hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya."
"466","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum apne murdon ko qabron mein rakho to kaho: Allah ke naam se aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki millat par. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha, aur Daraqutni ne ise mauqoof hone se ma'lul kaha."
"467","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maiyyat ki haddi todna us ke zinda todne jaisa hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne Muslim ki shart par sanad se riwayat kiya; aur Ibn Majah ne Umm Salamah ki hadees se izafa kiya: Gunah mein."
"468","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke mere liye lahd banao aur kachchi eenton ko khada rakho jaise Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath kiya gaya tha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur Baihaqi ke han Jabir se isi tarah hai aur izafa kiya ke us ki qabr zameen se ek balisht buland ki gayi; aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha. Aur Muslim ke han unhi se hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke qabr par gach kiya jae, us par baitha jae aur us par banaya jae."
"469","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amir bin Rabi'ah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Usman bin Maz'un par namaz padhi aur qabr par aae aur khade hote hue us par teen lapen dalin. Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya."
"470","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab maiyyat ke dafan se farigh hote to us par khade hote aur farmate: Apne bhai ke liye istighfar karo aur us ke liye sabat mango, kyunke abhi us se sawal hota hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"471","[AI-translation] Hazrat Damrah bin Habib jo tabi'in mein se hain se riwayat hai ke woh pasand karte the ke jab maiyyat par qabr barabar ki jae aur log us se wapas jaen to us ki qabr ke paas kaha jae: Aey falan! Kaho: La ilaha illallah, teen martaba; Aey falan! Kaho: Mera Rabb Allah hai, mera deen Islam hai aur mere Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hain. Ise Sa'id bin Mansur ne mauqoof riwayat kiya; aur Tabarani ke han Abu Umamah ki hadees se marfoo'an taweel isi tarah hai."
"472","[AI-translation] Hazrat Buraidah bin Husaib Aslami (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne tumhen qabron ki ziyarat se mana kiya tha to ab ziyarat karo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; Tirmidhi ne izafa kiya: Kyunke woh aakhirat yaad dilati hai. Ibn Majah ne Ibn Mas'ud ki hadees se izafa kiya: Aur duniya se be-raghbat karti hai."
"473","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qabron ki ziyarat karne wali aurton par la'nat ki. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"474","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne noha karne wali aur sunne wali par la'nat ki. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya."
"475","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham se ahad liya ke ham noha na karen. Muttafaq alaih."
"476","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Maiyyat ko us ki qabr mein us nohe ke sabab azab hota hai jo us par kiya jae. Muttafaq alaih; aur un donon ke han Mughirah bin Shu'bah (Raziyallahu anhu) se isi tarah hai."
"477","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki ek beti ko dafan hote dekha jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) qabr ke paas baithe the, to main ne Aap ki dono aankhon ko aansu bahate dekha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"478","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne murdon ko raat mein dafan na karo siwae is ke ke majboor ho jao. Ise Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya aur is ki asl Muslim mein hai, lekin unhon ne kaha: Aap ne mana kiya ke aadmi raat mein dafan kiya jae yahan tak ke us par namaz padhi jae."
"479","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Ja'far (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke jab Ja'far ki khabar aai jab woh qatl hue to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aal Ja'far ke liye khana banao kyunke unhen woh pahunchi hai jo unhen mashghool karegi. Ise Khamsa ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya."
"480","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sulaiman bin Buraidah apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unhen sikhate jab woh qabristan ki taraf niklte: Mu'min aur Musalman ghar walon par salam ho, aur beshak ham agar Allah ne chaha tum se milne wale hain, main Allah se hamare aur tumhare liye afiyat mangta hun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"481","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah ki qabron se guzre to apne chehre se un ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya: Aey qabr walon tum par salam ho, Allah hamen aur tumhen bakhshe, tum hamare agle ho aur ham naqsh qadam par hain. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur kaha: Hasan hai."
"482","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Murdon ko bura na kaho kyunke woh us ki taraf pahunch gae jo unhon ne aage bheja tha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur Tirmidhi ne Mughirah se isi tarah riwayat kiya lekin unhon ne kaha: To zindon ko takleef do."
